  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "The 1970 “Reflections” cycle rewritten in Greek: a revised version with lyrics by Nikos Gatsos (and one song by Agathi Dimitrouka), sung by Aliki Kagialoglou with Hadjidakis conducting. “Kemal” became “Κεμάλ”. The cover is a painting by Nikos Hadjikyriakos-Ghikas. One of the last records released in his lifetime."
